{"3949040":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"RV There Yet?","steam_appid":3949040,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4212020],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRIVE HOME<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your buddies are on your way home from a relaxing vacation but are forced to take an alternate route. Get your RV through the back country and find the exit to Route 65.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3949040\/extras\/b7dad463d2cf99641b2a64a655ad07f2.poster.avif?t=1789134289\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3949040\/extras\/b7dad463d2cf99641b2a64a655ad07f2.webm?t=1789134289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3949040\/extras\/b7dad463d2cf99641b2a64a655ad07f2.mp4?t=1789134289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE MABUTTS VALLEY<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Not everyone who enters Mabutts Valley makes it out alive. So be sure to keep a steady flow of burgers, antidotes, and the classic: EpiPens.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3949040\/extras\/c596855d607ab5cf7d875d403de714ab.poster.avif?t=1789134289\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3949040\/extras\/c596855d607ab5cf7d875d403de714ab.webm?t=1789134289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3949040\/extras\/c596855d607ab5cf7d875d403de714ab.mp4?t=1789134289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WINCH IT GOOD<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the physics based winch and earn the right to be the main remote commander. With a winch front and rear, your RV is especially equipped to get over, under or through most road bumps.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3949040\/extras\/b71d0bf11549cfb49bf17ea4f11e289f.poster.avif?t=1789134289\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3949040\/extras\/b71d0bf11549cfb49bf17ea4f11e289f.webm?t=1789134289\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3949040\/extras\/b71d0bf11549cfb49bf17ea4f11e289f.mp4?t=1789134289\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HELP YOURSELF, AND EACH OTHER<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help yourself to cold brewskis and filtered low tar cigarettes, but don’t forget that the driver will have a hard time completing this journey alone. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3949040\/extras\/4d0846231be4216c7d94eea6b0c4eb8f.poster.avif?t=1789134289\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_